###
GET http://localhost:8888/v1/lists HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

### Push a new item to a shopping list
POST http://localhost:8888/v1/lists/2/push HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [
        "NEW ITEM"
    ] 
}

### Push a no items to a shopping list
POST http://localhost:8888/v1/lists/2/push HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [] 
}